
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. EMPLOYEE.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01 WS-ID       PIC 9(4) VALUE 1001.
       01 WS-NAME     PIC X(15) VALUE 'RAJ'.
       01 WS-SALARY   PIC 9(6) VALUE 25000.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY WS-ID.
           DISPLAY WS-NAME.
           DISPLAY WS-SALARY.

           MOVE 30000 TO WS-SALARY.

           DISPLAY WS-SALARY.
           STOP RUN.
